{"3792120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue's Odyssey", "steam_appid": 3792120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5065480], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/0b6e7292fb8b7ba240b6ca9125c89b1a.avif?t=1787572841\" width=600 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Grind, Loot, Die, and repeat! </strong>Face hordes of monsters and challenging bosses in a 2.5D co-op roguelike ARPG. Combine skills across classes, creating thousands of unique builds, such as a potion-brewing Warrior or a wizardry Cat, the choice is yours!<strong> 🐱</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1e8cadb56babe200a64bb241f21735ff.poster.avif?t=1787572841\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1e8cadb56babe200a64bb241f21735ff.webm?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1e8cadb56babe200a64bb241f21735ff.mp4?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/00da46912302833057255227cc626891.avif?t=1787572841\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/56ac692b872524ad90bc2c78b12130c3.avif?t=1787572841\" width=600 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎒 Loot, loot, and more LOOT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 items for you to discover, each piece you collect and how you combine them, opens up fresh strategies and unlocks even more items in return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Node-based Item Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t just discover items by running around and hoping something will happen. Instead, you unlock new items in a node-based system, where every route you take may completely change your experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Mix &amp; Master Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a Warrior who slings potions like an Alchemist? Or a Wizard with the street smarts of a Merchant? Master your skills, then mix and match to build your own wild playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👫<strong>Unique Co-op Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are limited items to acquire in each level, and not everyone will end up equally powerful. So, who’s going to support the team? Who’s going to deal the damage? Plan your adventure wisely!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 <strong>MVP Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fallen boss drops an MVP Card for the most valuable player. These cards can enhance or even completely alter your skills mid-game, creating deeper customisation and new challenges that make planning your journey before pressing “Start” truly matter!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📜 Hiring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your death was not in vain. Other players can hire your AI characters, and you will be rewarded with special currency to unlock new features and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/85b43493a9ec50ce5894b81450a68396.avif?t=1787572841\" width=600 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/faf11cb2639ca722bb176f22348e9b77.poster.avif?t=1787572841\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/faf11cb2639ca722bb176f22348e9b77.webm?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/faf11cb2639ca722bb176f22348e9b77.mp4?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/d0d953102f0ed3b861e7bbb55c3a2aeb.poster.avif?t=1787572841\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/d0d953102f0ed3b861e7bbb55c3a2aeb.webm?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/d0d953102f0ed3b861e7bbb55c3a2aeb.mp4?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1af5bfb3de61a94e76ebc293779c0ee1.poster.avif?t=1787572841\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1af5bfb3de61a94e76ebc293779c0ee1.webm?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1af5bfb3de61a94e76ebc293779c0ee1.mp4?t=1787572841\" type=\"video/mp